{"id":"u49","kelas":"kerja","no":2,"judul":"Kehidupan Kantor dan Jabatan","title":"Office Life and Job Roles","emoji":"🏢","ringkas":"Divisi, jabatan, tugas harian, dan jadwal kerja","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut **divisi** dan **jabatan** umum di perusahaan","menjelaskan **tugas harian** memakai simple present dan kata keterangan frekuensi","membedakan simple present (rutinitas) dan present continuous (sedang dikerjakan)","menyebut **jadwal kerja**, jam kerja, dan fasilitas kantor","bertanya dan menjawab tentang pekerjaan: [[What do you do?]], [[What does your job involve?]]","membicarakan beban kerja dan prioritas dengan sopan"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Setiap kantor punya **divisi**, **jabatan**, dan **rutinitas**. Agar bisa bekerja sama, kamu perlu tahu cara menyebut siapa mengerjakan apa. Di unit ini kamu belajar kosakata kantor dan cara menjelaskan pekerjaanmu dengan jelas."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Divisi di perusahaan","table":[["Divisi","Tugas utama","Contoh kalimat"],["**Human Resources (HR)**","merekrut dan mengurus karyawan","[[HR hires and trains new staff.]]"],["**Finance / Accounting**","anggaran, gaji, laporan keuangan","[[Finance pays the salaries.]]"],["**Marketing**","promosi dan merek","[[Marketing plans our campaigns.]]"],["**Sales**","menjual produk dan jasa","[[Sales meets the customers.]]"],["**IT**","sistem, jaringan, dukungan teknis","[[IT fixes computer problems.]]"],["**Operations**","menjalankan proses harian","[[Operations manages daily work.]]"],["**Customer Service**","melayani pelanggan","[[Customer Service answers complaints.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Jabatan dan kosakata kantor","items":[{"en":"director","id":"direktur","ex":"The director leads the company."},{"en":"manager","id":"manajer","ex":"The manager approves the plan."},{"en":"team leader","id":"ketua tim","ex":"Our team leader assigns tasks."},{"en":"assistant","id":"asisten","ex":"The assistant books the meeting room."},{"en":"receptionist","id":"resepsionis","ex":"The receptionist greets visitors."},{"en":"accountant","id":"akuntan","ex":"The accountant checks the invoices."},{"en":"engineer","id":"insinyur","ex":"The engineer designs the system."},{"en":"intern","id":"peserta magang","ex":"The intern is learning fast."},{"en":"task","id":"tugas","ex":"I have three tasks today."},{"en":"deadline","id":"tenggat","ex":"The deadline is Friday."},{"en":"workload","id":"beban kerja","ex":"My workload is heavy this week."},{"en":"priority","id":"prioritas","ex":"This report is a top priority."},{"en":"shift","id":"giliran kerja","ex":"I work the morning shift."},{"en":"overtime","id":"lembur","ex":"We worked overtime last night."},{"en":"pantry","id":"pantri","ex":"Coffee is in the pantry."},{"en":"meeting room","id":"ruang rapat","ex":"The meeting room is on the second floor."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Rutinitas kerja: simple present","table":[["Pola","Contoh"],["Rutinitas","[[I start work at 8 a.m. and finish at 5 p.m.]]"],["Tugas rutin","[[She answers emails every morning.]]"],["Frekuensi","[[We always have a meeting on Monday.]] / [[He sometimes works overtime.]]"],["Negatif","[[I don't work on weekends.]] / [[He doesn't attend the meeting.]]"],["Tanya","[[What time does the office open?]] / [[Do you work in shifts?]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Letak kata keterangan frekuensi","text":"Kata seperti [[always]], [[usually]], [[often]], [[sometimes]], [[never]] diletakkan **sebelum kata kerja utama** tetapi **setelah to be**: [[She usually arrives early.]] / [[She is usually early.]]"},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Present continuous untuk pekerjaan saat ini","table":[["Pola","Contoh"],["Sedang dikerjakan","[[I'm preparing the monthly report.]]"],["Proyek sementara","[[We're working on a new product this month.]]"],["Perubahan","[[The company is growing quickly.]]"],["Rencana dekat","[[I'm meeting a client tomorrow.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Bertanya tentang pekerjaan","table":[["Pertanyaan","Contoh jawaban"],["[[What do you do?]]","[[I'm an accountant.]]"],["[[What does your job involve?]]","[[It involves checking invoices and preparing reports.]]"],["[[Who do you report to?]]","[[I report to the Finance Manager.]]"],["[[What are your working hours?]]","[[I work from 8 to 5, Monday to Friday.]]"],["[[How many people are in your team?]]","[[There are six of us.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Mengenal divisi","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Tom, what does the IT department do?","id":"Tom, apa yang dikerjakan departemen IT?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"We look after the computers and the network. We also help staff when they have problems.","id":"Kami mengurus komputer dan jaringan. Kami juga membantu staf ketika mereka punya masalah."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Who do you report to?","id":"Kamu melapor kepada siapa?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"I report to the IT manager, Mr. Adi. He usually checks our tasks every morning.","id":"Aku melapor kepada manajer IT, Pak Adi. Biasanya beliau memeriksa tugas kami setiap pagi."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Beban kerja","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Dina, how is your workload this week?","id":"Dina, bagaimana beban kerjamu minggu ini?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"It's quite heavy. I'm preparing two reports, and the deadline is Friday.","id":"Cukup berat. Aku sedang menyiapkan dua laporan, dan tenggatnya hari Jumat."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Which one is the priority?","id":"Mana yang menjadi prioritas?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"The sales report. Would it be possible to move the other one to Monday?","id":"Laporan penjualan. Apakah mungkin memindahkan yang satunya ke hari Senin?"},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Yes, that's fine. Let me know if you need help.","id":"Ya, tidak masalah. Beri tahu saya jika kamu butuh bantuan."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Menjelaskan pekerjaan dengan jelas","text":"Pakai pola **jabatan + divisi + tugas utama**: [[I'm a marketing officer. I plan social media campaigns and write reports.]] Gunakan kata kerja aktif seperti [[manage]], [[prepare]], [[check]], [[organise]], [[support]]."},{"t":"summary","items":["Divisi: HR, Finance, Marketing, Sales, IT, Operations, Customer Service.","Rutinitas: **simple present** + [[always/usually/often/sometimes/never]].","Sedang dikerjakan: **present continuous** ([[I'm preparing a report.]]).","Tanya: [[What do you do?]] / [[Who do you report to?]] / [[What does your job involve?]]","Beban kerja: sebut **prioritas** dan **tenggat** dengan sopan."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan divisi dengan tugasnya:","pairs":[["HR","merekrut karyawan"],["Finance","mengurus anggaran"],["IT","memperbaiki komputer"],["Sales","menjual produk"],["Marketing","merencanakan promosi"]],"exp":"Tugas utama divisi.","k":"346fb2c4"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["workload","beban kerja"],["deadline","tenggat"],["overtime","lembur"],["shift","giliran kerja"]],"exp":"Kosakata kerja.","k":"86d6e1f5"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jabatan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["receptionist","resepsionis"],["accountant","akuntan"],["intern","peserta magang"],["director","direktur"]],"exp":"Jabatan.","k":"7b6af701"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Divisi yang menangani rekrutmen adalah...","options":["HR","Finance","IT","Sales"],"answer":0,"exp":"HR mengurus karyawan.","k":"ff807ee4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Divisi yang memperbaiki masalah komputer adalah...","options":["IT","Marketing","HR","Operations"],"answer":0,"exp":"IT.","k":"e8959ff0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang benar adalah...","options":["She usually arrives early.","She arrives usually early.","She usually arrive early.","She is usually arrive early."],"answer":0,"exp":"usually sebelum kata kerja, verb-s.","k":"ef55e9f1"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat yang benar adalah...","options":["He is always on time.","He always is on time.","He is on time always.","He always are on time."],"answer":0,"exp":"Setelah to be.","k":"efd13376"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Untuk pekerjaan yang sedang dikerjakan, tense yang tepat adalah...","options":["present continuous","simple past","past perfect","future perfect"],"answer":0,"exp":"I'm preparing...","k":"21e8d5c3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang tepat untuk \"Who do you report to?\" adalah...","options":["I report to the Finance Manager.","I report at eight.","I work in Finance.","Yes, I do."],"answer":0,"exp":"report to = melapor kepada.","k":"7c7b3641"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang tepat untuk \"What does your job involve?\" adalah...","options":["It involves preparing reports.","I live in Bandung.","At nine o'clock.","No, thanks."],"answer":0,"exp":"involve = melibatkan.","k":"bcb1331d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan meminta menunda tugas adalah...","options":["Would it be possible to move it to Monday?","I won't do it.","Do it yourself.","Not my problem."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"880c181d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menunjukkan prioritas?","options":["This report is a top priority.","This report is blue.","This report is old.","This report is long."],"answer":0,"exp":"priority.","k":"abc03534"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya selalu mulai kerja pukul delapan.","q":"I ___ start work at 8 a.m.","answers":["always"],"hint":"selalu","exp":"always + V1.","k":"2de16fe0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia tidak bekerja pada akhir pekan.","q":"She ___ work on weekends.","answers":["doesn't","does not"],"hint":"negatif","exp":"doesn't + V1.","k":"57f3b726"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pukul berapa kantor buka?","q":"What time ___ the office open?","answers":["does"],"hint":"does","exp":"does + V1.","k":"cc70e663"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya sedang menyiapkan laporan.","q":"I'm ___ a report. (prepare)","answers":["preparing"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"am + V-ing.","k":"6badb7a9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia melapor kepada manajer.","q":"She reports ___ the manager.","answers":["to"],"hint":"kepada","exp":"report to.","k":"4ce8359d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tenggatnya hari Jumat.","q":"The ___ is Friday.","answers":["deadline"],"hint":"tenggat","exp":"deadline.","k":"995e